  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova: Emergency response for Ukrainian refugees (contribution to EA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Caritas Moldova

Contribution to Caritas Appeal: EA04/2022 Moldova

Total number of direct beneficiaries (individuals): 808

Context: Already one of the poorest countries in Europe, Moldova has seen an influx of over 100,000 Ukrainian refugees and more families are arriving daily. Approx. 45% of refugees entering Moldova have stayed in country.

Key activities: supporting host community mobilisation; provision of basic items like food, water, hygiene and living supplies; provision of psychosocial support.

Activity split:
50%: Food, nutrition &amp; livelihoods in emergencies
50%: Shelter in emergencies</narrative>
  </description>
